      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.751,
            0.063,
            0.834,
            0.08
          ],
          "content": "Fractions"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.121,
            0.724,
            0.146
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "7.8 Addition and Subtraction of Fractions"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.165,
            0.626,
            0.263
          ],
          "content": "Meena’s father made some chikki. Meena ate $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ of it and her younger brother ate $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ of it. How much of the total chikki did Meena and her brother eat together?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.647,
            0.163,
            0.82,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_24_image_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.229,
            0.269,
            0.556,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_24_image_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.348,
            0.833,
            0.392
          ],
          "content": "We can arrive at the answer by visualising it. Let us take a piece of chikki and divide it into two halves first like this."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.405,
            0.393,
            0.456
          ],
          "content": "Meena ate $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ of it as shown in the picture."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.41,
            0.395,
            0.833,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_24_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.468,
            0.834,
            0.539
          ],
          "content": "Let us now divide the remaining half into two further halves as shown. Each of these pieces is $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ of the whole chikki."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.55,
            0.39,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": "Meena’s brother ate $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ of the whole chikki, as is shown in the picture."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.406,
            0.535,
            0.833,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.407,
                0.622,
                0.504,
                0.637
              ],
              "content": "Brother ate 51"
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_24_image_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.63,
            0.427,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": "The total chikki eaten is $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ (by Meena) and $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ (by her brother)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.704,
            0.378,
            0.724
          ],
          "content": "The total chikki eaten"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.482,
            0.653,
            0.807,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_24_image_14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.724,
            0.242,
            0.753
          ],
          "content": "= { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } + { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_24_equation_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.683,
            0.734,
            0.831,
            0.751
          ],
          "content": "Total chikki eaten"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.768,
            0.277,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{4}",
          "image_source": "images/page_24_equation_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.815,
            0.283,
            0.844
          ],
          "content": "= 3 \\times { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } } = { \\frac { 3 } { 4 } } .",
          "image_source": "images/page_24_equation_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.863,
            0.604,
            0.885
          ],
          "content": "How much of the total chikki is remaining?"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
